# TOEIC Vocabulary Day57

| 단어 | 의미 | 예문 |
|---|---|---|
| deadline | 마감일 | We must meet the deadline. |
| deadline | 마감 기한 | The deadline is Friday. |
| procedure | 절차 | Please follow the standard procedure. |
| policy | 정책, 규정 | The company has a strict policy. |
| access | 접근, 이용 | Employees have access to the system. |
| entrance | 입구 | Please wait near the main entrance. |
| departure | 출발 | The departure time has changed. |
| destination | 목적지 | Seoul is our final destination. |
| appointment | 약속, 예약 | I have a doctor's appointment. |
| schedule | 일정, 일정 잡다 | The meeting is scheduled for Monday. |

### 암기 포인트

- meet a deadline: 마감일을 지키다
- follow a procedure: 절차를 따르다
- company policy: 회사 규정
- have access to: ~에 접근할 수 있다
- main entrance: 정문
- departure time: 출발 시간
- final destination: 최종 목적지
- schedule a meeting: 회의 일정을 잡다
